legpress:['Leg press','Legs · glutes · thighs',['Sit with your back and hips supported. Place your feet about shoulder-width apart on the platform.','Check the safety catches and push the platform away, keeping a slight bend in your knees.','Bend your knees under control without lifting your hips. Exhale as you press away.'],'Avoid snapping your knees straight. Secure the platform before leaving the machine.'],
