lat:['Lat pulldown','Back · biceps',['Adjust the thigh restraint and select your load. Grip the bar slightly wider than shoulder-width.','Sit tall with your feet supported and lean back slightly. Draw your shoulders down.','Drive your elbows down toward your sides, bringing the bar toward your upper chest. Return slowly.'],'Bring the bar in front of your head, never behind your neck. Avoid swinging your torso.'],
row:['Seated row','Back · rear shoulders',['Adjust the seat and support so you can reach the handles without rounding your back. Keep your feet stable.','Pull the handles toward your torso with your elbows close to your body and your spine neutral.','Pause briefly, then extend your arms slowly without jerking the weight.'],'Lead with your elbows and avoid leaning your whole body backward.'],
shoulder:['Shoulder press','Shoulders · triceps',['Adjust the seat so the handles start around shoulder height.','Support your back and feet. Exhale as you press up without arching your lower back.','Lower the handles slowly to a comfortable starting position. Keep your breathing steady.'],'Use a pain-free range of motion. Avoid shrugging your shoulders toward your ears.'],
