legextension:['Leg extension','Quadriceps',['Align the pivot with your knees and place the roller above your ankles.','Straighten your legs smoothly without snapping your knees into lockout.','Lower the load under control, keeping your back supported.']],
cable:['Adjustable cable station','Cables · full body',['Set both pulley heights and check that they lock securely.','Attach a handle, check the carabiner and select the load.','Perform your chosen movement without jerking, then return the handles carefully.'],'In the Upper body plan: rope triceps pushdowns, keeping your elbows close to your torso.'],
pullup:['Pull-up station','Back · biceps',['Reach the bar from a stable step and wrap your thumbs around it.','Initiate the pull with your shoulder blades and drive your elbows down.','Lower your body slowly without swinging your legs or torso.'],'Choose a suitable variation; an assistance band can help.'],
